  {
   "title": "等比数列 GP（L3）",
   "sources": [
    {
     "file": "L03_Geometric_Progressions.pdf",
     "pages": "p1–4"
    }
   ],
   "concept": "相邻两项的比为常数（<strong>公比 r</strong>，可正可负、可大于或小于 1）的数列叫<strong>等比数列</strong>（GP）：a, ar, ar², …\n<strong>通项</strong>：Tₙ = arⁿ⁻¹。\n<strong>求和</strong>（乘 r 再相减）：Sₙ = {{frac a(rⁿ − 1)|r − 1}}，或 Sₙ = {{frac a(1 − rⁿ)|1 − r}}（r < 1 时用后者更方便）。\n三个数 x、y、z 成 GP 当且仅当 y/x = z/y，即 y² = xz。",
   "formulas": [
    "Tₙ = arⁿ⁻¹",
    "Sₙ = {{frac a(rⁿ − 1)|r − 1}} = {{frac a(1 − rⁿ)|1 − r}}"
   ],
   "examples": [
    {
     "label": "例 19",
